  "description": "High-performance, dependency-free ORM for .NET 10+ with Native AOT support. Zero reflection, blazing-fast startup, minimal memory footprint. Built-in support for SQLite, PostgreSQL, MySQL, MongoDB, CouchDB, Cassandra. Automatic schema migrations, source-generated property accessors, and custom connection pooling. Perfect for serverless, microservices, and high-performance APIs.",
